    {
      "subId": "45401",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Razor",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4540101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4540101": {
            "id": "4540101",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "Who's there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4540102"
            ]
          },
          "4540102": {
            "id": "4540102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Chill out Razor, it's only us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4540103"
            ]
          },
          "4540103": {
            "id": "4540103",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "You... are also knight?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4540104"
            ]
          },
          "4540104": {
            "id": "4540104",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...So you don't know each other after all?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4540107"
            ]
          },
          "4540107": {
            "id": "4540107",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "No. This girl also red, but not so burny like other girl.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4540108"
            ]
          },
          "4540108": {
            "id": "4540108",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "This is starting to make sense. Is this the wolf boy you were talking about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4540109"
            ]
          },
          "4540109": {
            "id": "4540109",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Correct! His name is Razor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4540110"
            ]
          },
          "4540110": {
            "id": "4540110",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "Help me out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4540111"
            ]
          },
          "4540111": {
            "id": "4540111",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "With what?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4540112"
            ]
          },
          "4540112": {
            "id": "4540112",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "No time. I sent Lupical away. People coming, bad people.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4540113"
            ]
          },
          "4540113": {
            "id": "4540113",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Those guys from earlier?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4540114"
            ]
          },
          "4540114": {
            "id": "4540114",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "I understand. But first, I have a few questions—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4540115"
            ]
          },
          "4540115": {
            "id": "4540115",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "*sniff* I smell blood. Quick.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4540116"
            ]
          },
          "4540116": {
            "id": "4540116",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Blood? I hope the wolves didn't attack those idiots..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "45410",
      "subQuestName": "Check for strange things along the way",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "45411",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Amber",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4541101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4541101": {
            "id": "4541101",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Blood droplets!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541102"
            ]
          },
          "4541102": {
            "id": "4541102",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "Not human blood, wolf blood. Lupical blood...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541103"
            ]
          },
          "4541103": {
            "id": "4541103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Loopy what now? Are you gonna tell us what it means yet?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541104"
            ]
          },
          "4541104": {
            "id": "4541104",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "Lupical is family fate gave me. When wolf accepts human as its own. Or human accepts wolf. That is Lupical.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541105"
            ]
          },
          "4541105": {
            "id": "4541105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sounds like gibberish to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541106"
            ]
          },
          "4541106": {
            "id": "4541106",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "That's strange, where does the word come from? Surely it wasn't made up by the wolves?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541107"
            ]
          },
          "4541107": {
            "id": "4541107",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "It's just the name he gave.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541108"
            ]
          },
          "4541108": {
            "id": "4541108",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "...Who's \"he\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541109"
            ]
          },
          "4541109": {
            "id": "4541109",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "Guardian of this land.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541110"
            ]
          },
          "4541110": {
            "id": "4541110",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wouldn't that be Barbatos though? He is the ruler of Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541111"
            ]
          },
          "4541111": {
            "id": "4541111",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "Enough. Another clue. Follow me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541112"
            ]
          },
          "4541112": {
            "id": "4541112",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "Hey, wait! This is your chance to prove your innocence!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541113"
            ]
          },
          "4541113": {
            "id": "4541113",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He's already gone!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "45412",
      "subQuestName": "Catch up to Razor",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "45413",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Razor",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4541301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4541301": {
            "id": "4541301",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "This is him. We find his blood. Bad men did this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541302"
            ]
          },
          "4541302": {
            "id": "4541302",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How terrible...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541303"
            ]
          },
          "4541303": {
            "id": "4541303",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "I do agree that it's awful. But that doesn't change the fact that—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541304"
            ]
          },
          "4541304": {
            "id": "4541304",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "We didn't attack village! Not us!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541305"
            ]
          },
          "4541305": {
            "id": "4541305",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "A black wolf and his pack, not from here. They try to take over land. They broke the code.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541306"
            ]
          },
          "4541306": {
            "id": "4541306",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "<color=#00E1FFFF>Whose code?</color>",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541307"
            ]
          },
          "4541307": {
            "id": "4541307",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "Guardian of this land.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541308"
            ]
          },
          "4541308": {
            "id": "4541308",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amber",
            "text": "That's now the second time you've brought that up. Tell us who that is.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4541309"
            ]
          },
          "4541309": {
            "id": "4541309",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "I take Lupical further in. Follow me, maybe you see."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
